hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"455","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Rafiibn Ishaq"
"456","Yahya related to me from Malik from one of the Ansar that the Messenger of Allah"
"457","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban from his paternal uncle"
"458","Malik said that he meant someone who"
"459","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from A'isha"
"460","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"461","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"462","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"463","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Rabah and Ubaydullah ibn Abi Abdullah Salman al-Agharr from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"464","Yahya related to me from Malik from Khubayb ibn Abd ar-Rahman from Hafs ibn Asim from Abu Hurayra or from Abu Said al-Khudri that the Messenger of Allah"
"465","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from Abbad ibn Tamim from Abdullah ibn Zayd al-Mazini that the Messenger of Allah"
"466","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"467","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from Busr ibn Said that the Messenger of Allah"
"468","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Atika bint Zayd ibn Amr ibn Nufayl"
"469","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha"
"472","Yahya related to me from Malik from Dawud ibn al-Husayn from al- Araj from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abd al-Qari that Umar ibn al Khattab said"
"473","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"474","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abd al-Qari said that he had heard Umar ibn al-Khattab say"
"475","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"476","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from A'isha"